 "headline": [
  "On nobond_vt08, one sheet filled one open late is worth -929 CNY of NAV at the decision (median over 420 sheets, p10..p90 -10,440..5,993); waiting helped on 41% of them, the mean is -12.0 bps with t=-4.56. The 420 locals add up to the whole-book delay arm to 5e-15 log (residual, not assumed): that arm costs 1.88pp a year -- so the price is real in aggregate but a single late sheet is a coin flip -- budget it, do not argue with it.",
  "On nobond_base, one sheet filled one open late is worth -1,435 CNY of NAV at the decision (median over 420 sheets, p10..p90 -20,744..11,393); waiting helped on 41% of them, the mean is -18.8 bps with t=-4.29. The 420 locals add up to the whole-book delay arm to 4e-15 log (residual, not assumed): that arm costs 3.64pp a year -- so the price is real in aggregate but a single late sheet is a coin flip -- budget it, do not argue with it."
